(Moderate Spoilers)






Get your AC down even more. Another magic marker may come in handy there.
Remember that you can recharge markers.

You may be able to wish or polypile for more appropriate or powerful armor,
as well. SDSM and speed boots are good, though.

You also need to get your HPs maxed out a bit. A cursed scroll of genocide
could be useful, or you could go the potion route.

Get fire resistance another way. In my opinion, a ring of slow digestion is
more useful in that slot.

Magicbane's a great weapon, but I like to use something a little more
powerful later in the game. Keep working your god for something "heavier".

I try to remind myself that patience and planning sometimes have just as
good results as wishes. You just have to be vigilant in trying to find an
appropriate use for anything you come by, be it by actually using it,
polypiling it, or even canceling it. The castle or Ludios are especially
good places for use of this philosophy. (And a Spellbook of Polymorph is
pretty useful, too.)

Good luck!


